OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fevening, although a few heavy showers
OL,7,Fare possible, perhaps with the odd
OL,8,Frumble of thunder. Further showers
OL,9,Fthen spread north overnight,
OL,10,Foccasionally heavy and with frequent
OL,11,Flightning. However there is a chance
OL,12,Fthat the heaviest rain remains
OL,13,Foffshore.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FAny overnight rain easing.
OL,16,Fleaving a largely dry morning with
OL,17,Fsunny spells. Into the afternoon
OL,18,Fscattered showers are expected to
OL,19,Fdevelop, heavy at times, but with some
OL,20,Fparts staying dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
