OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FAn
OL,6,Funsettled bank holiday weekend with
OL,7,Fshowers, occasionally heavy and the
OL,8,Frisk of thunder. Likely turning rather
OL,9,Fwindy Monday. Temperatures near normal
OL,10,Fby day, but often staying rather mild
OL,11,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
